#### 5. `GET /family/memories` — Private Memory Feed (User Isolated)
* **File:** `src/family/memories/memories.service.ts` (`getMemories`)
* **Pagination Logic:**
  ```typescript
  const page = Math.max(1, Number(query?.page) || 1);
  const limit = Math.max(1, Math.min(100, Number(query?.limit) || 10));
  const skip = (page - 1) * limit;
  ```
* **Search Trim Logic:**
  ```typescript
  const searchTerm = (query?.search || query?.q || '').trim();
  if (searchTerm) {
    whereClause.AND = [
      {
        OR: [
          { title: { contains: searchTerm, mode: 'insensitive' } },
          { description: { contains: searchTerm, mode: 'insensitive' } },
          { sharedBy: { contains: searchTerm, mode: 'insensitive' } },
        ],
      },
    ];
  }
  ```
* **Response Envelope:** `return buildPaginatedResponse(mapped, total, page, limit);`
* **Status:** ✅ **100% Compliant**

