#### 9. `GET /family/activity` & `GET /family/activity-logs` — System Audit Logs
* **File:** `src/family/family.service.ts` (`getActivityLogs`)
* **Pagination Logic:**
  ```typescript
  const page = Math.max(1, Number(query?.page) || 1);
  const limit = Math.max(1, Math.min(100, Number(query?.limit) || 10));
  const skip = (page - 1) * limit;
  const paginated = filteredLogs.slice(skip, skip + limit);
  ```
* **Search Trim Logic:**
  ```typescript
  const searchTerm = (query?.search || query?.q || '').trim().toLowerCase();
  if (searchTerm) {
    filteredLogs = filteredLogs.filter(
      (l) =>
        l.title.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm) ||
        (l.user && l.user.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm)) ||
        l.type.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm),
    );
  }
  ```
* **Response Envelope:** `return buildPaginatedResponse(paginated, total, page, limit);`
* **Status:** ✅ **100% Compliant**

