#### 13. Single Entity GET Lookups (Key-Based)
* `GET /users/:id` -> Single User by UUID
* `GET /auth/me` -> Authenticated User Identity
* `GET /family/sanctuary` -> Sanctuary Overview Aggregates
* `GET /family/memories/:id` -> Single Memory Story with Author Ownership Guard
* `GET /family/events/:id` -> Single Event Record with Computed Status
* `GET /family/invitations/:id` -> Single Invitation Record
* `GET /family/chat/conversations/:id/messages` -> Full Conversation Thread History
* `GET /billing/plans` & `GET /billing/subscription` -> Pricing tiers & storage status
* `GET /health` -> Platform uptime and health telemetry

---

## 4. 🛠️ Actionable Recommendations to Achieve 100% Perfection

Based on the audit, here is what must be added to achieve complete symmetry:

1. **Add Relationship Deletion & Editing:**
   - Add `DELETE /family/relationships/:id` and `PATCH /family/relationships/:id` to `relationships.controller.ts` & `relationships.service.ts`.
   - Add Unlink button to `RelationshipsTab.tsx`.
2. **Add Single Member Detail Lookup:**
   - Add `GET /family/members/:id` to `members.controller.ts` & `members.service.ts`.
   - Add "Edit Member" modal to `MembersTab.tsx`.
3. **Add Document Rename PATCH:**
   - Add `PATCH /family/documents/:id` to allow renaming document titles or updating categories.
4. **Add Event RSVP:**
   - Add `EventRsvp` model to Prisma and endpoints `POST /family/events/:id/rsvp` and `GET /family/events/:id/rsvps`.

